OL,13,G1900 The Great Devon & Cornwall Floods
OL,14,     FIn 1952 a flash flood in Lynmouth,
OL,15,     FDevon, caused the death of 34
OL,16,     Fpeople as debris smashed into
OL,17,     Fbuildings. Then exactly 52 years
OL,18,     Flater, an eerily similar event
OL,19,     Fstruck Boscastle in Cornwall.
